    "updated_at": "2016-09-09T09:29:14Z",
    "body": "I think we can merge this and see if browsers align with this. There is a small benefit of this approach over the WebKit/Edge 14.14393 behavior in that it is closer to IE, where `innerText` has existed for the longest time, so maybe there is Web content expecting IE-like behavior. I should add more tests for this as well.\n",
